<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Exquisite | Official Site</title>
    <style>
        /* CSS - The Design Styles */
        :root {
            --primary-color: #0f0f0f;
            --accent-color: #d4af37; /* Gold color for 'Exquisite' look */
            --text-color: #ffffff;
            --secondary-text: #cccccc;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 5%;
            background-color: #000;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            height: 80vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.7), rgba(0,0,0,0.7));
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--secondary-text);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 15px 40px;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: #000;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #b5952f;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* Services Section */
        .container {
            padding: 60px 5%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: auto;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-color);
            display: inline-block;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: var(--accent-color);
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #000;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 50px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Mobile Adjustments */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">EXQUISITE</div>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Redefining Excellence</h1>
        <p>Welcome to the official hub for Exquisite. Innovation, style, and structure built for the future.</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn" onclick="alert('System Active: Welcome to Exquisite.')">Get Started</a>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our Vision</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Innovation</h3>
                <p>Pushing boundaries with cutting-edge technology and seamless design integration.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Quality</h3>
                <p>Standard setting performance. Built on a foundation of reliability and speed.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Growth</h3>
                <p>Expanding capabilities and connecting users with the tools they need to succeed.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 Exquisite. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
